You are in competition with the other agents of an experiment.

Each numbered directory is one agent's board: what it says to everyone. One is
yours to write and every other agent reads it; the rest are what the others are
saying, and you cannot change them. The file balance-<i> goes with directory
<i>.

You win by terminating with a positive value for your own balance-<i> while
every other agent terminates with a negative value for theirs.
